    <!-- 中欄 -->
    <div class="cell">
      <div class="blk">
        <h2 class="en">PROFILE</h2>
        <p class="zh-lead">
          <span data-lang="zh">做網站第 8 年，從切版一路做到能自己扛完一個案子。擅長把設計稿的細節不打折地實作出來，也能在時程壓縮時判斷哪裡該收、哪裡不能讓。習慣在動工前先把資料結構和後台流程想清楚，因為那通常才是案子會不會爆的地方。</span>
          <span data-lang="en">Eight years building websites, from slicing layouts to running an entire project alone. I implement design without cutting corners, and I know which details can go when a deadline tightens. I map out the data structure and the CMS flow before writing code, because that is usually where a project falls apart.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="blk">
        <h2 class="en">CORE SKILLS</h2>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar"><i>HTML / CSS</i><span class="track"><b data-w="96"></b></span><span class="pct">96</span></div>
