        <h3 class="en" data-scramble>FOREST ROASTERY</h3>
        <p class="sub"><span data-lang="zh">森林咖啡烘豆所｜品牌官網 + 線上訂購</span><span data-lang="en">Forest Roastery — brand site &amp; online store</span></p>
        <p class="desc">
          <span data-lang="zh">單頁滾動敘事搭配產地地圖，把烘焙曲線做成可互動的圖表。訂購流程刻意壓到三步完成，行動版轉換率上線後成長約四成。</span>
          <span data-lang="en">A single-page scrolling narrative with an origin map, and roast curves rendered as interactive charts. Checkout was deliberately cut to three steps; mobile conversion rose about 40% after launch.</span>
        </p>
        <dl class="roles"><dt class="en">MY ROLE</dt><dd>
          <span><span data-lang="zh">前端開發</span><span data-lang="en">Front-end</span></span>
          <span><span data-lang="zh">互動設計</span><span data-lang="en">Interaction Design</span></span>
